expression: "help_output(&[subcommand, \"--help\"])"
---
Usage: xmind completion [OPTIONS] <SHELL>

Arguments:
  <SHELL>  [possible values: bash, elvish, fish, powershell, zsh]

Options:
      --json                       
      --format <FORMAT>            [default: text] [possible values: text, json, compact-json, markdown, outline, assets]
      --fields <FIELDS>            
      --quiet                      
      --no-color                   
      --sheet <SHEET>              
      --sheet-id <SHEET_ID>        
      --sheet-index <SHEET_INDEX>  
  -h, --help                       Print help
